<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Conceptual diagram illustrating a research design with three ideation methods as the independent variable, creative tendency as a moderator, and two dependent variable outcomes: cognitive creativity and perceived creativity support, along with the associated research questions RQ1, RQ2, and RQ3.) /K 570 0 R /P 59 0 R /Pg 9 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
525 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Flowchart illustrating a study design with three main sections: Participants, Ideation Phase, and Survey and Interview. The Participants section includes creativity tendency assessment and participant recruitment, with an icon of a checklist and a person. The Ideation Phase presents three counterbalanced tasks: unaided, internet-assisted, and GenAI-assisted, shown beside a drawing of a chair and pencil. The final section, Survey and Interview, lists an online post-task survey and semi-structured interview, accompanied by an illustration of two people facing each other with a laptop.) /K 571 0 R /P 59 0 R /Pg 10 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
526 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Nine panels, each showing hand-drawn chair concept sketches in black ink with handwritten notes in Chinese, are organized by three participants labeled P1, P2, and P3, across three task panels per participant in a grid format.) /K 572 0 R /P 59 0 R /Pg 11 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
527 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Bar chart comparing three groups\204unaided, internet-assisted, and GenAI-assisted\204across four creativity measures: fluency, flexibility, originality, and elaboration. Unaided and internet-assisted groups score significantly higher than GenAI-assisted in fluency, flexibility, and originality, with elaboration scores similar across groups. Statistically significant differences are marked with one, two, or three asterisks, indicating higher scores for internet-assisted or unaided groups except in elaboration.) /K 573 0 R /P 59 0 R /Pg 12 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
528 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Bar chart comparing scores for usability, exploration, expressiveness, immersion, enjoyment, and result worth effort across unaided, internet-assisted, and GenAI-assisted conditions. GenAI-assisted generally shows higher or equal scores, with statistically significant differences denoted by asterisks above specific bars. Error bars represent variability.) /K 574 0 R /P 59 0 R /Pg 12 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
